//: selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_materializer_connector_bound_solution_hash_result: bound solving status を[検査/けんさ]して instantiation 用 hash を[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_generic_materializer_connector_bound_solution_hash_result %fn i32 fn SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericBoundSolvingStatus Result i32 SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericMaterializerConnectorErrorKind \expected_bound_count\status:
    if:
